{"seq":1,"slug":"black-litterman-model","title":"Black-Litterman 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/robust-allocation-methods/black-litterman-model","wordCount":1838,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"black-litterman-模型\">Black-Litterman 模型</h1><p>直接对历史收益率做均值-方差优化的人很快会撞墙：把某只资产的预期收益调高 1%，最优权重可能从 5% 跳到 60%，再调回去权重又塌缩到 0。这种「估计误差放大器」效应让 Markowitz 框架在实盘里几乎无法直接使用。Black 与 Litterman 在 1990 年代初于高盛提出的解法不是修补优化器，而是换掉输入：先用市场均衡反推一组「中性」预期收益，再用贝叶斯方法把投资者的主观观点掺进去，得到一组平滑、可解释、对扰动不敏感的后验收益。这正是它被归入「稳健配置方法」的原因——稳健性来自更好的输入估计，而非对权重施加硬约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Black-Litterman（下文简称 BL）把资产配置拆成两个独立可证伪的环节：先确定一个所有人都同意的起点（市场隐含均衡收益），再把每个人各自不同的私有信息（观点）作为「证据」更新这个起点。两者通过贝叶斯定理融合，产出后验收益向量，最后才喂给优化器。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[市值权重 w_mkt&lt;br/&gt;+ 协方差 Σ] --&gt; B[反向优化&lt;br/&gt;π = λ Σ w_mkt]&#10;    B --&gt; C[均衡先验&lt;br/&gt;N π, τΣ]&#10;    D[投资者观点矩阵 P&lt;br/&gt;+ 观点收益 Q] --&gt; E[观点不确定性 Ω]&#10;    C --&gt; F[贝叶斯融合]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[后验收益 μ_BL]&#10;    G --&gt; H[均值-方差优化器]&#10;    H --&gt; I[最终权重&lt;br/&gt;稳健 / 分散]\">flowchart TD\n    A[市值权重 w_mkt&lt;br/&gt;+ 协方差 Σ] --&gt; B[反向优化&lt;br/&gt;π = λ Σ w_mkt]\n    B --&gt; C[均衡先验&lt;br/&gt;N π, τΣ]\n    D[投资者观点矩阵 P&lt;br/&gt;+ 观点收益 Q] --&gt; E[观点不确定性 Ω]\n    C --&gt; F[贝叶斯融合]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[后验收益 μ_BL]\n    G --&gt; H[均值-方差优化器]\n    H --&gt; I[最终权重&lt;br/&gt;稳健 / 分散]</pre><p>下表对比裸均值-方差优化与 BL 的关键差异，解释了为何后者被视作稳健方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>裸均值-方差（Markowitz）</th>\n<th>Black-Litterman</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收益输入来源</td>\n<td>历史样本均值</td>\n<td>均衡先验 + 观点的贝叶斯后验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对输入扰动的敏感度</td>\n<td>极高（误差放大）</td>\n<td>低（先验锚定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无观点时的输出</td>\n<td>角点解、极端集中</td>\n<td>退化为市值组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观点表达方式</td>\n<td>无原生机制</td>\n<td>绝对/相对观点 + 置信度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>差，权重难归因</td>\n<td>强，权重偏离可追溯到具体观点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反向优化与隐含均衡收益\">反向优化与隐含均衡收益</h2><p>整套模型的稳健性根植于这一步：与其猜每个资产未来涨多少，不如假设当前市值组合本身就是最优组合，反推出「市场已经相信」的那组预期收益。这组收益被称为隐含均衡超额收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，由反向优化给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi = \\lambda \\Sigma w_{mkt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是资产超额收益协方差矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{mkt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是市值权重向量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是市场风险厌恶系数（通常由市场超额收益除以市场方差估出，约 2.0–3.0）。这个公式正是均值-方差优化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = (\\lambda\\Sigma)^{-1}\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 的逆运算（<a href=\"https://people.duke.edu/~charvey/Teaching/BA453_2006/Idzorek_onBL.pdf\">Idzorek, A Step-by-Step Guide to the Black-Litterman Model</a>）。</p>\n<p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 作为起点的好处是：如果投资者没有任何观点，BL 的后验收益就等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，优化器吐出的权重恰好回到市值组合——一个天然分散、人人都持有的合理基准。裸均值-方差则在无观点时给出极端角点解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用观点矩阵表达主观信息\">用观点矩阵表达主观信息</h2><p>观点是 BL 区别于纯被动配置的地方，用三个对象编码。观点拾取矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>（每行一个观点）指明该观点涉及哪些资产；观点收益向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 给出每个观点对应的预期收益数值；观点不确定性矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>（对角矩阵）刻画对每个观点的信心。</p>\n<p>观点分两类。绝对观点直接断言「资产 A 的年化超额收益为 3%」，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 行里只有 A 处为 1。相对观点断言「A 跑赢 B 共 2%」，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 行里 A 处为 1、B 处为 -1、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 对应元素为 0.02。相对观点尤其有用，因为投资者往往对「谁强谁弱」比对「绝对涨幅」更有把握。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 的标定历来是模型最棘手的旋钮。一种常用做法把每个对角元设为与观点组合方差成正比：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_k = \\tau \\cdot P_k \\Sigma P_k^{\\top}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1322em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即把信心绑定到观点所涉资产本身的波动率（<a href=\"https://hudsonthames.org/bayesian-portfolio-optimisation-the-black-litterman-model/\">Hudson &amp; Thames, Bayesian Portfolio Optimisation</a>）。另一种是 Idzorek 提出的「置信百分比」映射：投资者直接给出「我对这个观点有 60% 把握」，方法反解出对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 元素，避开了直接拍方差的难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贝叶斯融合与后验收益\">贝叶斯融合与后验收益</h2><p>把均衡先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(\\pi, \\tau\\Sigma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与观点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(Q, \\Omega)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 通过贝叶斯定理合并，得到后验预期收益向量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>P</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>Q</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{BL} = \\left[(\\tau\\Sigma)^{-1} + P^{\\top}\\Omega^{-1}P\\right]^{-1}\\left[(\\tau\\Sigma)^{-1}\\pi + P^{\\top}\\Omega^{-1}Q\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4531em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1031em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.352em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直观上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{BL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 的精度加权平均：观点越确信（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 越小），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{BL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越往该观点拉；观点越含糊，结果越贴近均衡先验。这种「加权平均」结构是后验收益对单点扰动不敏感的根本原因——任何单个观点的极端值都会被先验和其余观点稀释。</p>\n<p>标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 缩放先验本身的不确定性，文献中通常取 0.025–0.05，越小代表越信任均衡先验。2025 年一篇把 LLM 生成的预测当作观点输入 BL 的工作（ICLR 2025）就沿用了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.025</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = 0.025</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.025</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.14345\">Integrating LLM-Generated Views into Black-Litterman, arXiv:2504.14345</a>）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值长期众说纷纭，被称为模型「最令人困惑的特征」，实务上常把它和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 一起当作整体的「先验 vs 观点」相对权重来调，而非各自孤立标定（<a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/228317768_The_Factor_Tau_in_the_Black-Litterman_Model\">Walters / The Factor Tau in the Black-Litterman Model</a>）。</p>\n<p>拿到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{BL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后，最后一步是常规的均值-方差优化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = (\\lambda\\Sigma)^{-1}\\mu_{BL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。因为输入已经被平滑过，输出权重平稳、分散，且每一处对市值的偏离都能追溯到某个具体观点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的工程实践与新方向\">2026 年的工程实践与新方向</h2><p>到 2026 年，BL 仍是机构资产配置的主流稳健框架，但「观点」的来源正在被重写。传统上观点靠基金经理人工拍板；近两年的研究把另类数据——社交媒体情绪、卫星影像、信用卡交易流水——结构化成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>，让观点生成本身自动化（<a href=\"https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=3464770\">Cayirli, The Black-Litterman Model: Extensions and Asset Allocation, SSRN</a>）。更激进的一支用大语言模型直接产出带置信度的预测观点，连同其自评信心一起注入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>，绕开人工标定（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.14345\">arXiv:2504.14345</a>）；另有混合预测模型用多元分解加降噪先生成收益预测再喂 BL（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2505.01781v2\">arXiv:2505.01781</a>）。ESG 投资是另一条落地路线：投资者把 ESG 偏好编码成观点，让组合在保持均衡分散的同时倾斜向符合价值观的资产。</p>\n<p>落地时直接调库即可，Python 生态里 <code>PyPortfolioOpt</code> 提供了 <code>BlackLittermanModel</code> 类，覆盖反向优化、Idzorek 置信法与后验融合的完整链路（<a href=\"https://pyportfolioopt.readthedocs.io/en/latest/BlackLitterman.html\">PyPortfolioOpt, Black-Litterman Allocation</a>），无需手写矩阵求逆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>BL 的稳健性来自换掉输入而非约束输出：用市场隐含均衡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi = \\lambda\\Sigma w_{mkt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作中性起点，避免历史均值的误差放大。</li>\n<li>观点用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>（涉及哪些资产）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>（预期收益）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>（信心）三者编码，支持绝对观点与相对观点。</li>\n<li>后验收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_{BL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是先验与观点的精度加权平均，单个极端观点会被稀释，因而对扰动不敏感。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>（约 0.025–0.05）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 共同决定「信均衡 vs 信观点」的天平，实务上常整体调而非孤立标定。</li>\n<li>2026 年的前沿在观点来源：另类数据、LLM 生成观点、ESG 偏好正取代纯人工拍板；工程上用 <code>PyPortfolioOpt</code> 等库即可落地。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Black-Litterman 模型","id":"black-litterman-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"反向优化与隐含均衡收益","id":"反向优化与隐含均衡收益"},{"level":2,"text":"用观点矩阵表达主观信息","id":"用观点矩阵表达主观信息"},{"level":2,"text":"贝叶斯融合与后验收益","id":"贝叶斯融合与后验收益"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的工程实践与新方向","id":"2026-年的工程实践与新方向"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"估计误差与 MPT 的局限 — Estimation Error and the Limits of MPT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/modern-portfolio-theory/estimation-error-and-limits"},"next":{"title":"风险平价与风险预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/robust-allocation-methods/risk-parity-and-budgeting"}}